Question. 9 Write a query to display the department name, manager name, and city.

SELECT 
    d.department_name, 
    CONCAT(e.first_name, ' ', e.last_name) AS manager_name, 
    l.city 
FROM departments d 
JOIN employees e 
    ON d.manager_id = e.employee_id 
JOIN locations l 
    ON d.location_id = l.location_id;
